ame that fits how you win.</p><a href=\"#v-{{sid}}\" class=\"star cursor-target\" style=\"--sc:white;--sr:255,255,255\"><span class=\"bgb\"></span><span class=\"bgt\"></span><span class=\"inn\">Explore The Series <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></span></a></section>\n<section class=\"reveal\"><p class=\"rtext\">Attack hard. Strike clean. Place sharp. Move first. Pro Series gives every player a clear weapon.</p></section>\n<div class=\"div\"></div>\n<section id=\"v-{{sid}}\" class=\"chap\" style=\"--ac:#22c55e;--rgb:34,197,94;--gl:rgba(34,197,94,.15)\"><div class=\"bg\"></div><div class=\"blur\"></div><div class=\"thread\"><i></i></div><div class=\"inner\"><div class=\"vis\"><span class=\"orb\"></span><img src=\"https://in.hndrd.co/cdn/shop/files/1_958d5bed-b55e-4cf4-9900-2052ba8b5bea.jpg?v=1752848941&width=900\" alt=\"Nitrix 70 Venom\"></div><div class=\"copy\"><p class=\"ser\">Attack Series</p><h2>Nitrix 70<br>Venom</h2><h3>Heavy Smashes. Clean Finish.</h3><p class=\"desc\">Built for aggressive players who want heavier attacks, stronger follow-through and a sharper hit on contact.</p><div class=\"spec\"><div><b>6.1mm</b><span>Shaft</span></div><div><b>M46X</b><span>Carbon</span></div><div><b>32 Lbs</b><span>Tension</span></div></div><a href=\"https://in.hndrd.co/products/nitrix-70-venom\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"star cursor-target\" style=\"--sc:#22c55e;--sr:34,197,94\"><span class=\"bgb\"></span><span class=\"bgt\"></span><span class=\"inn\">Enter Attack Mode <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></span></a></div></div></section>\n<div class=\"div\"></div>\n<section class=\"chap\" style=\"--ac:#3b82f6;--rgb:59,130,246;--gl:rgba(59,130,246,.15)\"><div class=\"bg\"></div><div class=\"blur\"></div><div class=\"thread\"><i></i></div><div class=\"inner rev\"><div class=\"copy\"><p class=\"ser\">Power Series</p><h2>Nitrix 70<br>Volta</h2><h3>Clean Power. Faster Swing.</h3><p 